      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLD FORCE (6) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 5 lengths at Q Lakeside in a handy 25.07. Jumping from the pinch draw but goes well over this trip. Comes out of a hot form race last start. Can measure up again. SECRET STORY (3) has a strong record here with 17 wins and 11 placings from 29 starts. Missed the frame latest (19.20) when fourth over 350m at Healesville in a Special conditions G3. Looks suited here and can measure up. CASINO SPECIAL (1) has missed the frame the last couple but just a few runs back pushed the clock when winning over 352m at Q Lakeside, taking a Grade 3/4 in a slick 19.68. Expecting another bold showing. SOMEONE'S IDEA (2) in the money here last time and looks a top-three prospect again.",
